{
  "info": {
    "name": "Binay Job Portal - NestJS API",
    "_postman_id": "binay-job-portal-api",
    "description": "Complete API collection for the Binay Job Portal.\n\n## Authentication\n\nThis API uses **HTTP-only cookies** for auth. Cookies are set automatically by the server on login/signup/refresh.\n\n### How to use in Postman:\n1. **Login first** via `POST /api/v1/auth/login` — server sets cookies automatically\n2. All subsequent requests will include cookies automatically (Postman handles this)\n3. **Alternatively**, extract `access_token` from login response and use `Authorization: Bearer <token>` header\n4. Cookie priority: `binay_access_token` > `Authorization: Bearer`\n\n### Cookies set by server:\n| Cookie | Purpose | Path |\n|--------|---------|------|\n| `binay_access_token` | JWT access token | `/` |\n| `binay_refresh_token` | Refresh token | `/api/v1/auth/refresh` |\n| `binay_presence_session` | Presence tracking | `/api/v1` |\n\n### Flow:\n`Signup` → `Login` → `Refresh` (when token expires) → `Logout`\n\nBase URL: `http://localhost:3002`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3002"
    },
    {
      "key": "companyId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "jobId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "candidateId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "applicationId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "resumeId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "invitationId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "interviewId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "memberId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "branchId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "deptId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "teamId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "guestSessionId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "guestUploadToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "documentId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "apikey",
    "apikey": [
      {
        "key": "key",
        "value": "Cookie",
        "type": "string"
      },
